{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t港交所推出離岸人民幣債券指數，追蹤在香港發行的超過300隻「點心債」。<br/>\n<br/>\n出席儀式的財政司司長陳茂波表示，指數可以為投資者提供清晰的市場表現基準，提供便捷途徑投資於多元化的離岸人民幣債券組合。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T12:17:34.983782+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:51:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T21:37:21.846458+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T12:11:11.774216+00:00","content_hash":"bb661235c9e285f33922117c2e2bfe72ca5a4f0987e4e8e6ee6e744c255d0748","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}